This product includes capabilities and implementations absorbed from WebMux
(https://github.com/windmill-labs/webmux), frozen at commit
d8c9d5fa2fc061bff1425de2910d784a48961f1e (v0.43.1, 2026-08-14), which is
acknowledged here as an architectural origin.

No unit of that project's authorship is reproduced verbatim in this repository.
Every absorbed unit was ported or adapted to the Node.js runtime, because the
WebMux backend is Bun-only and does not compile under Node without translation.
The origin-to-destination mapping for every ported unit is recorded in
docs/provenance.md, and the behavioural chain for every ported module is
recorded in docs/absorption-trace.md.

One file matches byte for byte: packages/issue-flow/web/src/vite-env.d.ts, two
lines of triple-slash references that the Vite and Svelte scaffolds emit
identically in every project of that shape. It is the toolchain's text rather
than that project's, and it is named here so the paragraph above can stay a
precise claim instead of a nearly true one.

WebMux declares "license": "MIT" in its package.json and publishes no LICENSE
file. While that remains the case, no verbatim copy is made from it.
